# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CODEOWNERS — who must review which paths
#
# The ruleset requires a pull request but zero approvals, because this repository
# has a single maintainer and self-approval is not possible on GitHub. Ownership
# is still declared so a future collaborator inherits the right review scope, and
# so `require_code_owner_review` can be switched on without editing this file.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner>...
# Docs:   https://docs.github.com/repos/github/creating-cloning-and-archiving-repositories/about-code-owners
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

